      "tts_text": "Welcome to The Bahamas, a nation of warm turquoise waters and easy island rhythms; our capital, Nassau, sits on New Providence, where the pastel houses of Parliament Street lead toward the famous Queen's Staircase, a landmark carved from solid limestone.",
      "tts_text_zh": "欢迎来到巴哈马，这个国家拥有温暖的碧蓝海水与悠闲的岛屿节奏；我们的首都拿骚位于新普罗维登斯岛，议会街的粉彩色房屋一路通向著名的女王阶梯，这处地标由坚硬的石灰岩开凿而成。",
      "audio_voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
